{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14229170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14229170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422916001:":{"text":"낚였어요!","source_cn":"上钩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC40F7BA08D2AC923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1422917001:0":{"text":"낚싯대에 걸린 물고기의 힘은 상상을 초월하는 것이었다. 아델린이 힘껏 당겨보았지만, 결국 팽팽했던 낚싯줄은 끊어지고 물고기는 저 깊은 곳으로 도망쳤다...","source_cn":"上钩的神秘大鱼力气惊人，阿黛琳奋力拉扯，然而鱼线却不堪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB0517A5F07F7ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422917002:0":{"text":"방금 그거, 피쉬킹인 걸까요? 아까워요! 제가 더 튼튼한 낚싯줄로 바꿨어야 했는데!","source_cn":"刚刚上钩的是鱼王吗？好可惜！都怪我，应该换更结实的鱼线的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074BBA9F070D3F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422917003:0":{"text":"몸집이랑 그 힘을 보면 확실하지! 피쉬킹이 네 미끼를 물었다면... 내가 확실히 꼬마 아가씨를 얕본 것 같네.","source_cn":"这个体型和力量，十有八九是了！鱼王竟然咬了你的钩，看来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D330D750E11519E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422917004:0":{"text":"그럼 두람이 정말 사기꾼이었던 걸까요... 거기서 산 붉은 새우는 피쉬킹은 커녕 평범한 잡어도 안 낚였잖아요...","source_cn":"所以那个杜兰姆真的是在骗人吗……他卖给我的赤虾饵不光鱼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397620607689C39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422917005:0":{"text":"이제야 의심이 들기 시작해? 그래도 완전히 멍청이는 아니라 다행이네.","source_cn":"总算开始怀疑了？看来你还没有笨得彻底嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x996239DC2FA9FD40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422917006:0":{"text":"그 미끼, 분명 비늘가루 같이 자극적인 냄새가 나는 걸 섞어둔 거야 물에 들어가면 그 냄새가 훨씬 더 심해져서 주변의 물고기들이 도망가거나 입질도 안 하거든. 진짜 배고픈 녀석이나 간신히 물려나?","source_cn":"那些鱼饵里八成掺了气味呛鼻的滑鳞粉，一旦放入水中，周围...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31471D5B250F4E08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422917007:0":{"text":"냄새 좀 맡아볼게요... 진짜네요! 이런 코를 찌르는 냄새는 처음이에요. 물에 넣으니까 더 심해지고요!","source_cn":"我闻闻！真的有一股呛鼻的味道！放进水里后，这股味道更加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24519612DE48E0DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422917008:0":{"text":"그래야 네가 미끼가 부족한가 싶어서 그 사기꾼에게 미끼를 더 사러 가거든. 그렇게 되면 더 비싼 미끼를 팔아먹으려는 거야. 아주 치밀하게 짜놨어.","source_cn":"这样钓不上鱼来的你才会怀疑是不是投的饵不够多，进而找他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF9C673012823FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422917009:0":{"text":"두람, 어떻게 그럴 수가! 친구가 됐다고 생각했는데... 당장 가서 따져야겠어요!","source_cn":"杜兰姆怎么能这样！我还以为他真的把我当朋友，我要去找他算账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x879A47FAF6CE83C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422917010:0":{"text":"딱 맞춰서 왔네.","source_cn":"刚好，他这不就来了嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BAED2D0621E009C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1422917011:0":{"text":"두람이 우락부락한 드워프 몇 명을 데리고 씩씩대면서 나타났다.","source_cn":"杜兰姆气冲冲地出现了，身后还跟着几个强壮的矮人打手，看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89C9924B45D4F334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422917012:0":{"text":"어이, 저기야! 저 망할 여자 드워프가 내 낚시터에 들어와서 돈 한 푼 안 내고 낚시질을 했다고! 혼쭐을 내줘!","source_cn":"兄弟们，就是那个女矮人闯进我的钓场钓鱼，连一分钱都不掏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x457CCF97CD6DE651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422917013:0":{"text":"돈도 안 내고 낚시를 하려고?","source_cn":"不给钱还想钓鱼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAF92BC299CE7BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422917014:0":{"text":"가진 돈이나 다 내놓으시지!","source_cn":"把你身上的钱都掏出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x818D837AF3DF5DF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1422917015:0":{"text":"하나도 안 무섭거든!","source_cn":"我可不怕你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD18902EDE41381E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1422917016:0":{"text":"왜, 왜 사람을 때리려고 하는 거예요? 멈추세요!","source_cn":"你们、你们怎么能打人呢？住手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x763DEC75D54127DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:14022929:0":{"text":"기계 부품을 호수에 던졌더니 잠시 후, 호수가 출렁이며 신비한 대어가 낚였다.","source_cn":"你们把机械部件放入湖中，不一会儿，湖里有了动静，一只神...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x103A68109D6225D2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"기계 부품을 호수에 던졌더니 잠시 후, 호수가 출렁이며 신비한 대어가 낚였다.","female":"기계 부품을 호수에 던졌더니 잠시 후, 호수가 출렁이며 신비한 대어가 낚였다.","variant_male_record_index":"168158","variant_female_record_index":"168159","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿黛琳":{"text":"아델린","source":"阿黛琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人玛尼娅":{"text":"드워프 마니아","source":"矮人玛尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人杜兰姆":{"text":"드워프 두람","source":"矮人杜兰姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:凶悍的矮人打手":{"text":"난폭한 드워프 폭력배","source":"凶悍的矮人打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蛮横的矮人打手":{"text":"거친 드워프 폭력배","source":"蛮横的矮人打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow